{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood for Nobody Else is a short story and physics-based challenge to split logs in two.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're underpaid, overworked, and what you can do is never enough.<br><br>Your task is simple: make it through the week. The bills have to be paid somehow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse-based gameplay aiming and controlling your trusty axe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each log splits where you strike the wood  - keep it clean and do your best!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring based on your ability to chop accurately and be a good worker.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original short story and dialog for seven in-game days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient, lo-fi soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Existential dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3849700?t=1753891246","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3849700?t=1753891246","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849700/a427229b13e626ca021a1a4791a4164702c8bad4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753891246","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849700/a427229b13e626ca021a1a4791a4164702c8bad4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753891246","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wood for Nobody Else is a short story and physics-based challenge to split logs in two.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're underpaid, overworked, and what you can do is ne